data: {"text":"Your filter sits hidden at the bottom under the rack. I'll confirm the official manual link before I write the steps.","type":"say"}

data: {"action":{"queries":["Bosch 800 Series SHX878WD5N manual filter system remove rinse under tap"],"query":"Bosch 800 Series SHX878WD5N manual filter system remove rinse under tap","type":"search"},"type":"search"}

data: {"plan":{"appliance":"dishwasher","brand":"Bosch","diagnosis":"Grit is likely food and debris being washed back onto dishes. A dirty round filter in the floor, or blocked spray holes, is the most common cause on this Bosch.","library_id":"","library_problem":"","manual_url":"https://www.bosch-home.com/us/owner-support/get-support/support-selfhelp-dishwashers-cleaning-dishwasher-filter","model_number":"SHX878WD5N","replacement_parts":[],"safety":["Wait until the inside is cool before reaching in.","Watch for knives, broken glass, or sharp edges in the filter area.","Do not run the dishwasher with the filter left out."],"steps":[{"check":"The bottom rack is out and you can see the tub floor.","details":["Open the door fully first.","The rack rolls toward you."],"instruction":"Pull the bottom rack straight out","motion":"pull_out","photo":0,"show_3d":false,"target_part":"metal bottom floor of dishwasher interior"},{"check":"You are holding the round filter parts in your hand.","details":["It is in the center of the floor.","Twist gently â€” do not force it."],"instruction":"Twist the round floor filter left and lift","motion":"twist_ccw","photo":0,"show_3d":true,"target_part":"round mesh filter in the floor of the tub"},{"check":"You can see through the mesh and no food remains.","details":["Use a soft brush only.","No steel wool â€” it can tear the mesh."],"instruction":"Rinse the filter parts under warm water","motion":"rinse","photo":0,"show_3d":false,"target_part":"round mesh filter in the floor of the tub"},{"check":"All tiny holes look open and clear.","details":["The arm just above the bottom rack lifts or snaps off on many models.","Poke blocked holes gently with a toothpick."],"instruction":"Check the lower spray arm holes for food","motion":"lift","photo":0,"show_3d":true,"target_part":"round mesh filter in the floor of the tub"},{"check":"The filter sits flat and will not wobble.","details":["Line up the two arrows.","If it sits raised, grit can slip past it."],"instruction":"Twist the filter back in until arrows meet","motion":"twist_cw","photo":0,"show_3d":true,"target_part":"round mesh filter in the floor of the tub"},{"check":"Test dishes feel smooth, with no sand-like grit.","details":["Put the bottom rack back first.","If grit stays, the spray arms may need a pro check."],"instruction":"Run a normal wash with a few dishes","motion":"none","photo":-1,"show_3d":false,"target_part":"round mesh filter in the floor of the tub"}],"tools":["soft brush","old toothpick","towel"]},"type":"plan"}

